D[8407] = {"Lucha por Garganta Grito de Guerra",{"Don't forget the fight for Warsong Gulch is about more than just protecting trees. It's about keeping a natural barrier between Ashenvale and the Barrens. Do you bring any news from the battlefield, <nombre>?"}}
